BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fa25a6b56fba6de3@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20261123T223222Z
DTSTART:20261209T223000Z
DTEND:20261210T003000Z
SUMMARY:Beginning Sewing
LOCATION:Kingsbury Makerspace
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/18037547
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Come learn the basics of sewing by making a simple small zippe
 red bag.\n\nTo participate in this workshop please complete the online tut
 orial: Introduction to the Makerspace\n\nThis workshop is intended to intr
 oduce basic sewing skills through making a zippered bag. All materials are
  provided. If you have questions please contact A Welby awelby@keenenh.gov
  or Amy Kraemer at akraemer@keenenh.gov\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5613c6ab2e8d49aa@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20261123T223222Z
DTSTART:20261210T230000Z
DTEND:20261211T003000Z
SUMMARY:So you want to start a family?
LOCATION:Masiello Classroom
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17729320
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Raising your children is a constitutional right.  Marriage is 
 a contract.  Come find out the terms before you sign\, with Keene Family L
 aw attorneys  Sofia Cunha-Vasconcelos and Lindsey Bramble. The program wil
 l address key points regarding marriage and having children in New Hampshi
 re for a majority of relationships\, recognizing that there are many diffe
 rent kinds of relationships and the laws in other states may differ.\n\nIn
 formation in this seminar is legal education\, not legal advice.  Attendan
 ce does not constitute the creation of an attorney client relationship.”
 \nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
