 k-off-4/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Brooks Memorial Library
DESCRIPTION:The Friends of the Library’s Annual Book Sale will begin on 
 Saturday\, November 28th. Remainders will be available through the end of 
 the year during regular library hours. \nMost items will be $3 or less and
  you will have the opportunity to purchase raffle tickets for some fabulou
 s literary-themed gift baskets. \nProceeds from the sale support the patro
 ns of the Brooks Memorial Library by funding programming\, museum passes\,
  and much much more!\nSource: Brooks Memorial Library
