DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261125T150000
SUMMARY:Putney Amblers Walking Group
URL:https://putneylibrary.org/event/putney-amblers-walking-group-4/2026-11
 -25/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Putney Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Would you like to get outside and walk in the company of other
 s? The Putney Amblers is a casual walking group sponsored by Putney Public
  Library. Moseying with others is a great way to get out and be a part of 
 a community group.\nThe Putney Amblers meet for walks on Wednesdays\, chan
 ging spots and routes each week. Please feel free to join us on an impromp
 tu basis\, or email Susan Heimer to register to get weekly location and we
 ather-related updates: heimer.susan@gmail.com  Walks will last from 60-90 
 minutes depending on the will of the group.\nSource: Putney Public Library
END:VEVENT
