SUMMARY:Tales Well Told: The Bedquilt and A Quilting Bee in Our Village
URL:https://tockify.com/gnatevents
CATEGORIES:kids\,GNAT-TV Regional Calendar (mountain towns)
DESCRIPTION:Tales Well Told: The Bedquilt and A Quilting Bee in Our Villag
 e — In this enthralling performance\, two ageless American stories retur
 n us to the days when quilting created community. We join a gaggle of town
 swomen—and meet a solitary spinster—who fashion remarkable art for eve
 ryday use. “Despite TV and films\, the Internet and special effects\, we
  still crave simply to listen to a tale well told.” -Michele LaRue\nSour
 ce: GNAT-TV Regional Calendar (mountain towns)
END:VEVENT
